  "issue": {
    "id": "I_kwDOBiM5Uc8AAAABDtuuLw",
    "databaseId": 4544245295,
    "number": 3364,
    "title": "rqt_controller_manager crash on lyrical",
    "url": "https://github.com/ros-controls/ros2_control/issues/3364",
    "body": "**Describe the bug**\nThe plugin crashes on lyrical.\n\n**To Reproduce**\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\n1. `rqt --standalone rqt_controller_manager.controller_manager.ControllerManager`\n2. see crash with `AttributeError: type object 'Qt' has no attribute 'CustomContextMenu'`\n\n\n**Expected behavior**\nno crash\n\n**Screenshots**\n```\nPluginManager._load_plugin() could not load plugin \"rqt_controller_manager/ControllerManager\":\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/plugin_handler.py\", line 102, in load\n    self._load()\n    ~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/plugin_handler_direct.py\", line 55, in _load\n    self._plugin = self._plugin_provider.load(self._instance_id.plugin_id, self._context)\n                   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/composite_plugin_provider.py\", line 72, in load\n    instance = plugin_provider.load(plugin_id, plugin_context)\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/composite_plugin_provider.py\", line 72, in load\n    instance = plugin_provider.load(plugin_id, plugin_context)\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/rqt_gui_py/ros_py_plugin_provider.py\", line 69, in load\n    return super(RosPyPluginProvider, self).load(plugin_id, ros_plugin_context)\n           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/composite_plugin_provider.py\", line 72, in load\n    instance = plugin_provider.load(plugin_id, plugin_context)\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/rqt_gui/ros_plugin_provider.py\", line 107, in load\n    return class_ref(plugin_context)\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/rqt_controller_manager/controller_manager.py\", line 105, in __init__\n    ctrl_table_view.setContextMenuPolicy(Qt.CustomContextMenu)\n                                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: type object 'Qt' has no attribute 'CustomContextMenu'\n```\n\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\n - OS: Ubuntu 26.04\n - Version Lyrical\n- Anything that may be unusual about your environment\n\n**Additional context**\nAdd any other context about the problem here, especially include any modifications to ros2_control that relate to this issue.\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Describe the bug</strong><br>\nThe plugin crashes on lyrical.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>To Reproduce</strong><br>\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">rqt --standalone rqt_controller_manager.controller_manager.ControllerManager</code></li>\n<li>see crash with <code class=\"notranslate\">AttributeError: type object 'Qt' has no attribute 'CustomContextMenu'</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Expected behavior</strong><br>\nno crash</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Screenshots</strong></p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"PluginManager._load_plugin() could not load plugin &quot;rqt_controller_manager/ControllerManager&quot;:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File &quot;/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/plugin_handler.py&quot;, line 102, in load\n    self._load()\n    ~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File &quot;/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/plugin_handler_direct.py&quot;, line 55, in _load\n    self._plugin = self._plugin_provider.load(self._instance_id.plugin_id, self._context)\n                   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File &quot;/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/composite_plugin_provider.py&quot;, line 72, in load\n    instance = plugin_provider.load(plugin_id, plugin_context)\n  File &quot;/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/composite_plugin_provider.py&quot;, line 72, in load\n    instance = plugin_provider.load(plugin_id, plugin_context)\n  File &quot;/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/rqt_gui_py/ros_py_plugin_provider.py&quot;, line 69, in load\n    return super(RosPyPluginProvider, self).load(plugin_id, ros_plugin_context)\n           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File &quot;/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/composite_plugin_provider.py&quot;, line 72, in load\n    instance = plugin_provider.load(plugin_id, plugin_context)\n  File &quot;/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/rqt_gui/ros_plugin_provider.py&quot;, line 107, in load\n    return class_ref(plugin_context)\n  File &quot;/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/rqt_controller_manager/controller_manager.py&quot;, line 105, in __init__\n    ctrl_table_view.setContextMenuPolicy(Qt.CustomContextMenu)\n                                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: type object 'Qt' has no attribute 'CustomContextMenu'\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">PluginManager._load_plugin() could not load plugin \"rqt_controller_manager/ControllerManager\":\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/plugin_handler.py\", line 102, in load\n    self._load()\n    ~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/plugin_handler_direct.py\", line 55, in _load\n    self._plugin = self._plugin_provider.load(self._instance_id.plugin_id, self._context)\n                   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/composite_plugin_provider.py\", line 72, in load\n    instance = plugin_provider.load(plugin_id, plugin_context)\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/composite_plugin_provider.py\", line 72, in load\n    instance = plugin_provider.load(plugin_id, plugin_context)\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/rqt_gui_py/ros_py_plugin_provider.py\", line 69, in load\n    return super(RosPyPluginProvider, self).load(plugin_id, ros_plugin_context)\n           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/qt_gui/composite_plugin_provider.py\", line 72, in load\n    instance = plugin_provider.load(plugin_id, plugin_context)\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/rqt_gui/ros_plugin_provider.py\", line 107, in load\n    return class_ref(plugin_context)\n  File \"/opt/ros/lyrical/lib/python3.14/site-packages/rqt_controller_manager/controller_manager.py\", line 105, in __init__\n    ctrl_table_view.setContextMenuPolicy(Qt.CustomContextMenu)\n                                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: type object 'Qt' has no attribute 'CustomContextMenu'\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Environment (please complete the following information):</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>OS: Ubuntu 26.04</li>\n<li>Version Lyrical</li>\n<li>Anything that may be unusual about your environment</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Additional context</strong><br>\nAdd any other context about the problem here, especially include any modifications to ros2_control that relate to this issue.</p>",
